I find I can often destroy a ghost using nothing but my starting 
+1QS at basic with a Wiz [it takes a while]. Your pet may be able 
to hit it [kittens don't seem to, but I think housecats can]

If you're going to use spells I'd certainly recommend MM until you 
know FB won't kill anything that might be in the bones pile. [Also, 
since either spell can miss the ghost, and a Wiz is immune to MM if 
wearing the starting cloak, using a wall to reflect the MM gives 
you 2 chances to hit it cf FB's 1...]

Frankly, though, I wouldn't worry about it too much, ghosts do 
little damage, and are very slow, lead it a little way off into the 
dungeon, run past it, and worry about finishing it off some time 
later. [You don't want to spend most of your energy fighting a 
ghost, only to find several bigger nasties just around the corner].

